    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Thiamin 100 mg IV = given to tx or prevent Wernicke encephalopathy, in intoxication (w IVF; many add MVIs and magnesium) and in w.draw."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Acamprosate, a synthetic GABA analog, 2 g orally Q1x day, may decrease relapse and drinking days."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Disulfiram blocks acetaldehyde met, so drinking w.in 12 hrs → flushing, HA and tachy; w ↑doses of EToH, N/V may follow. It = contraindicated in preg and ♡ decompensation; 0.5 g Q1x day for 1-3 wks, then 0.25 g; its use = now limited."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
